{'name': "Renaud's Patisserie & Bistro", 'address': '3315 State St', 'city': 'Santa Barbara', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'French, Cafes, Restaurants, Breakfast & Brunch, Food, Sandwiches, Bakeries', 'hours': {'Monday': '0:0-0:0', 'Tuesday': '6:30-16:0', 'Wednesday': '6:30-16:0', 'Thursday': '6:30-16:0', 'Friday': '6:30-16:0', 'Saturday': '6:30-16:0', 'Sunday': '6:30-15:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': {'garage': False, 'street': False, 'validated': False, 'lot': True, 'valet': False}, 'RestaurantsReservations': False, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': {'touristy': False, 'hipster': False, 'romantic': False, 'divey': False, 'intimate': False, 'trendy': False, 'upscale': False, 'classy': True, 'casual': True}}, 'business_stars': 4.5, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-18 18:26:49', 'review_text': 'Wow wow wow! Stopped here on our way home to OC from Los Olivos and had their croissant egg breakfast sandwich, fresh squeezed OJ and chocolate croissant. Literally BEST. IVE. EVER. HAD! So excited we found a place for breakfast on our way home!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-14 20:02:25', 'review_text': 'Delicious croissant breakfast sandwich! Friendly staff, cute ambiance, quick service.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-05 17:09:20', 'review_text': "We have enjoyed Renaud's many times, for breakfast, lunch, special desserts or just a snack. But I was really blown away this year by their Galette Des Rois (King's Cake) to celebrate Epiphany (January 6). 

