{'name': 'Santa Ynez Burrito', 'address': '956 Embarcadero Del Norte Hwy', 'city': 'Goleta', 'state': 'CA', 'categories': 'Restaurants, Mexican', 'hours': {'Monday': '11:0-23:0', 'Tuesday': '11:0-23:0', 'Wednesday': '11:0-23:0', 'Thursday': '11:0-23:0', 'Friday': '11:0-23:0', 'Saturday': '11:0-23:0', 'Sunday': '11:0-23:0'}, 'attributes': {'BusinessParking': None, 'RestaurantsReservations': True, 'OutdoorSeating': True, 'WiFi': 'free', 'RestaurantsTakeOut': True, 'RestaurantsGoodForGroups': True, 'Music': None, 'Ambience': None}, 'business_stars': 3.0, 'review_info': [{'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2016-06-07 00:01:08', 'review_text': 'Their 5$ Breakfast Burritos are my staple. Super filling, enough for 2 meals. I love their green salsa, its just enough spicy to make you sweat but enough flavor for you to keep adding it to your food.

The owner is really sweet! and the ambience is nice. A great place to check out!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2016-05-28 20:01:08', 'review_text': "Service was excellent and really clean location. The food was delicious; had the chimichanga and burrito. Trust me, it's worth it :)"}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2016-05-15 07:49:55', 'review_text': "My first time here, I got a chicken burrito with the works. Delicious. I enjoyed it than all the other burritos in IV. The chicken was flavorful, everything was warm. It hit the craving spot. 

